C-HASH Implementations
======================

Directory Structure
-------------------
Implementations/
|-- Reference_Implementation/
|   |-- C-HASH-512/     C-Hash-512 reference implementation
|   |-- C-HASH-1024/    C-Hash-1024 reference implementation
|-- Optimized_Implementation/
|   |-- C-HASH-512/     C-Hash-512 performance-optimized (AVX2)
|   |-- C-HASH-1024/    C-Hash-1024 performance-optimized (AVX2)
|-- Additional_Implementation/
    |-- C-HASH-512/     C-Hash-512 resource-optimized (-Os)
    |-- C-HASH-1024/    C-Hash-1024 resource-optimized (-Os)

Build Instructions
------------------

Reference Implementation:
    gcc -O2 -std=c99 -Wpedantic -Wall -Wextra -o c-hash \
        c-hash.c CryptHash_AlgorithmInstance.c drng.c -lm

Optimized Implementation:
    gcc -O3 -march=x86-64 -mavx2 -mtune=native -flto \
        -fomit-frame-pointer -std=c99 -o c-hash \
        c-hash.c CryptHash_AlgorithmInstance.c drng.c -lm

Additional (Resource-Optimized) Implementation:
    gcc -Os -march=x86-64 -mavx2 -flto \
        -fomit-frame-pointer -std=c99 -o c-hash \
        c-hash.c CryptHash_AlgorithmInstance.c drng.c -lm

Files per Instance
------------------
c-hash.c                    Core algorithm implementation
c-hash.h                    Public API header
CryptHash_AlgorithmInstance.c  ICCS API wrapper
CryptHash_AlgorithmInstance.h  ICCS API header
drng.c                      Deterministic Random Number Generator
drng.h                      DRNG header
KAT_CryptHash.c             Known Answer Test vector generator
README.txt                  Instance-specific notes

Test Vector Generation
----------------------
Compile and run KAT_CryptHash.c to generate test vectors:
    gcc -O2 -o kat_gen KAT_CryptHash.c c-hash.c \
        CryptHash_AlgorithmInstance.c drng.c -lm
    ./kat_gen
